      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir41">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e98">Caput 41</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir41-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir41-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir41_1@1-2">O mors,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir41-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir41-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e113">Qui prosperitatem mundi et divitias amat, amara est illi mors corporalis, quia futurae vitae gaudia negligit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir41-Dd1e117">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e119">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir41-d1e121">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1223B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e125" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir41_5@15-16">Hoc judicium.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir41-Rd1e128"><name xml:id="gom-sir41-Nd1e129" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e132">Commune est omni carni, nec quisquam evadere potest, etiamsi centum aut mille annos vixerit aut ultra; unde: <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e134" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps88_49@1-9">Quis est homo qui vivet, et non videbit mortem?</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir41-Dd1e140">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e142">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir41-d1e144">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e146" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir41_8@1-2">Filii abominationum.</quote>
            Abominabiles sunt filii peccatorum, qui scilicet, impios patres imitati sunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir41-Dd1e151">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e153">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir41-d1e155">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e157" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir41_10@1-3">De patre impio.</quote>
            Qui male filios nutrit, vel exemplo perdit, reus est eorum perditionis. Vel, qui mala opera de prava voluntate gignit, damnabitur pro eis
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir41-Dd1e163">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e165">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir41-d1e167">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e169" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir41_13@13-14">In perditionem.</quote>
            Superioribus respondet, in quibus de morte temporali disputavit: quia sicut homo de terra creatus pro peccato originali in <pb ed="#P" n="1223C"/> terram redit, quamvis in incorruptione surrecturus; sic impii pro peccatis suis maledicti, in aeternam perditionem cum corpore et anima ibunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir41-Dd1e176">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e178">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir41-d1e180">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e182" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir41_15@1-5">Curam habe de bono nomine,</quote>
            etc. Ut bene et religiose vivas. Sic autem acquiritur bonum nomen.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir41-Dd1e187">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e189">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir41-d1e191">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e193" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir41_18@1-7">Melior est homo qui abscondit stultitiam suam,</quote>
            etc. Qui abscondet frumentum, maledicetur in populis, benedictio autem super caput vendentium.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir41-Dd1e198">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e200">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir41-d1e202">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e204" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir41_19@1-6">Verumtamen revertimini in his quae procedunt.</quote>
            Quia bonum nomen et bonam et vitam utilem esse praedixit, et occultantes scientiam reprehendit, suadet ut revertantur ad studium docendi, quia non est bonum irreverentem et inobedientem <pb ed="#P" n="1223D"/> esse suo doctori.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir41-Dd1e211">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e213">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir41-d1e215">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e217" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir41_20@1-7">Non est bonum omnem irreverentiam observare.</quote>
            Juxta litteram, nos instruit ut a vitiis caveamus, et virtutibus operam demus, et ne spretis melioribus, eligamus pejora, quae sequitur confusio sempiterna.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir41-Dd1e222">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e224">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir41-d1e226">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e228" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir41_26@2-6">Non avertas faciem tuam a proximo tuo,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir41-Rd1e231"><name xml:id="gom-sir41-Nd1e232" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e235"><seg type="qs">Cum angeli colligent de Ecclesia omnia scandala</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et fornicationibus haereticorum se miscuit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir41-Dd1e245">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir41-Hd1e247">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir41-d1e249">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir41-Qd1e251" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir41_27@1-5">Ne respicias mulierem alieni viri,</quote>
            etc. Cupiditatem carnalem quae debet subesse spiritui, hanc non debemus scrutari et suggestionibus ejus subjici.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
